OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAI could cause global economic
OL,4,Adownturn, Andrew Bailey warns G20
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an open letter to finance ministers
OL,7,Fin the US on Monday, he said companies
OL,8,Faround the world should prepare for
OL,9,Fsecurity breaches "involving
OL,10,Fsimultaneous disruption across multiple
OL,11,Ffirms".
OL,13,FEarlier this month, a group of 100
OL,14,Ffirms, including Google, Microsoft,
OL,15,FAnthropic and OpenAI, urged countries
OL,16,Fand groups to beef up their cyber
OL,17,Fdefences before AI grows powerful
OL,18,Fenough to override them.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
